							"parentStyle": false,
							"left": 3864,
							"top": 576,
							"width": 136,
							"height": 131,
							"text": "<<Strategy>>\nDifferent Algorithms decide which room/time is \"best\". We can swap policies per faculty/semester without changing SchedulingService."
